\begin_layout Standard
We take the sine basis 
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
f_{j}(x)\coloneqq\braket x{j_{x}}=\sqrt{\frac{2}{L_{x}}}\sin\frac{\pi j_{x}x}{L_{x}},\qquad j_{x}=1,2,\ldots,M.
\]

\end_inset

Note that 
\begin_inset Formula $j_{x}=0$
\end_inset

 is not included because it makes no sense to include function 
\begin_inset Formula $f(x)=0$
\end_inset

 in the basis.
\end_layout

