 and we do not care about factors of 2,
 
\begin_inset Formula $\frac{\d x}{L_{x}}$
\end_inset

,
 and 
\begin_inset Formula $\zeta_{j_{x}^{\prime}}\zeta_{j_{x}}$
\end_inset

 here)
